==English==

===Etymology===
'''[[fanny]]''' (British colloquial slang for a ''[[vagina]],'' not a fanny or rear-end) + '''[[fart]]''' (emission of a gas.)

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[fanny]] [[fart]]}}

# {{slang}} A noise made by the emission of air from the [[vagina]], usually associated with a physical activity such as [[intercourse|shagging]].